---
import SiteLayout from "../components/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Pack Shield Support">
  <main id="content" class="site-shell legal-page">
    <article class="glass-panel legal-article">
      <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
      <h1>Help with Pack Shield</h1>
      <p>
        For support, bug reports, privacy questions, or App Store review questions, email <a href="mailto:support@packshield.app">support@packshield.app</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Bug Reports</h2>
      <p>
        Helpful bug reports include what you tapped, what you expected to happen, what actually happened, your iPhone or iPad model, and your iOS version. Screenshots are useful when they do not include sensitive information.
      </p>

      <h2>Purchases</h2>
      <p>
        Optional Shibit suit suites are purchased through Apple's In-App Purchase system. Use Restore Purchases in Pack Shield settings to ask the App Store to restore eligible purchases.
      </p>

      <h2>Text Messages</h2>
      <p>
        Pack Shield text messages support phone verification, sponsor invitations, Shield notices, and user-requested accountability alerts. Message frequency varies based on user and sponsor actions. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.
      </p>

      <h2>Safety</h2>
      <p>
        Pack Shield is not medical advice, therapy, treatment, emergency response, or crisis care. If you are in immediate danger, contact local emergency services.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
